notes = "(!) One Mono-I system ROM is required; any one of the system ROM files above will do.|(!) cdi220b.rom (md5): ac0d468be366779c9df633be98da250a|(!) cdi200.rom (md5): 2969341396aa61e0143dc2351aaa6ef6|(!) cdi220.rom (md5): ac80a92c988ce07fbd6a8f21ded34cf1 (truncated, use cdi220b.rom)|(!) cdi490a.rom (md5): f0f4e0bf948930b50be8f97730463e34 or word-swapped 0e341073c04879b8dfb690c1b9568275|(!) vmpega.rom (md5): 53ba3bf7443187a657baa272d01d3771 (optional, needed by Digital Video titles such as The Lost Ride; impega.rom is not emulated)|[i] Core option "DVC cartridge": auto (default) fits vmpega.rom when found, off leaves it out; takes effect when content is loaded.|[i] Word-swapped dumps are fixed on load; zip MD5s depend on the packer, the ROMs inside are checked.|[i] The core log names the file it used and why any other was skipped."
